	["Debilitate drains mana from everyone within 45 yards, and Drain Vitality wears down the tank: dispel it. A race before your mana runs out. He is immune to arcane."] = "Debilitar drena maná a todos los que estén a menos de 45 m, y Drenar vitalidad desgasta al tanque: disípenlo. Es una carrera contra el tiempo antes de quedarse sin maná. Es inmune a lo arcano.",
	["Defeat 2 Dragonmaw Saboteurs and 4 Dragonmaw Warders, recover the Dragonmaw Dispatch, and report to the Deathstalker Agent outside the dungeon."] = "Derrota a 2 Saboteadores Faucedraco y 4 Depositarios Faucedraco, recupera el Despacho Faucedraco e informa al Agente Mortacechador fuera del calabozo.",
	["Defeat 8 Seeking Remnants, 8 Saturated Remnants, and 8 Mana Echoes inside the City of Dalaran for Archmage Modera outside of Dalaran."] = "Derrota a 8 Remanentes buscadores, 8 Remanentes saturados y 8 Ecos de maná en la Ciudad de Dalaran para la Archimaga Modera, que está fuera de Dalaran.",
	["Defeat Atrexis the Grave Knight in the Dalaran Underbelly."] = "Derrota a Atrexis, el Caballero de la tumba, en los Bajos Fondos de Dalaran.",
	["Defeat Charlga Razorflank in Razorfen Kraul and collect information on the quilboar's plans."] = "Derrota a Charlga Filonavaja en el Horado Rajacieno y reúne información sobre los planes de los jabaespines.",
	["Defeat Edwin VanCleef and collect his head."] = "Derrota a Edwin VanCleef y consigue su cabeza.",
	["Defeat Lorgus Jett in Blackfathom Deeps."] = "Derrota a Lorgus Jett en las Cavernas de Brazanegra.",
	["Defeat Twilight Lord Kelris and recover the Head of Kelris."] = "Derrota al Señor Crepuscular Kelris y recupera la Cabeza de Kelris.",
	["Defeating him opens the door onward."] = "Derrotarlo abre la puerta para seguir adelante.",
