	["Item start: Nostro's Compendium of Dragon Slaying, inside Dire Maul"] = "Objeto inicial: Compendio de matar dragones de Nostro, dentro de La Masacre",
	["Item start: Shattered Necklace, dropped by the Shadowforge dwarves and Stonevault troggs around Uldaman"] = "Objeto inicial: Collar destrozado, botín de los enanos Forjatiniebla y los troggs Grutacanto de los alrededores de Uldaman",
	["Item start: Small Scroll, dropped by Charlga Razorflank"] = "Objeto inicial: Pergamino pequeño, botín de Charlga Filonavaja",
