	["Kibler, Burning Steppes"] = "Kibler, Las Estepas Ardientes",
	["Kill 10 Defias Prisoners, 8 Defias Convicts, and 8 Defias Insurgents inside The Stockade."] = "Mata a 10 Prisioneros Defias, 8 Presidiarios Defias y 8 Insurgentes Defias en Las Mazmorras.",
	["Kill 15 Enraged Apparitions and 10 Tormented Souls, then put Anvilmar's spirit to rest."] = "Mata a 15 aparecidos iracundos y a 10 almas atormentadas, y luego da descanso al espíritu de Yunquemar.",
	["Kill 20 Plagued Hatchlings, then return to Betina Bigglezink at the Light's Hope Chapel."] = "Mata a 20 Crías de dragón apestadas y luego regresa junto a Betina Bigglezink en la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz.",
	["Kill 7 Deviate Ravagers, 7 Deviate Vipers, 7 Deviate Shamblers and 7 Deviate Dreadfangs."] = "Mata a 7 devastadores descarriados, 7 víboras descarriadas, 7 arrastrapiés descarriados y 7 colminfernos descarriados.",
	["Kill 8 Ragefire Troggs and 8 Ragefire Shamans inside Ragefire Chasm."] = "Mata a 8 troggs Furia Ardiente y a 8 chamanes Furia Ardiente en la Sima Ígnea.",
	["Kill 8 Razorfen Battleguard, 8 Razorfen Thornweavers, and 8 Death's Head Cultists and return to Myriam Moonsinger near the entrance to Razorfen Downs."] = "Mata a 8 guardias de batalla de Rajacieno, 8 tejespinas de Rajacieno y 8 cultores Caramuerte, y regresa con Myriam Lunacanta cerca de la entrada de la Zahúrda Rajacieno.",
	["Kill a Highland Horror within Excavation Sites and bring its root core to Rethiel the Greenwarden in the Wetlands."] = "Mata a un Horror de las Tierras Altas en los Sitios de Excavación y lleva su núcleo de raíz a Rethiel el Guardaverde en Los Humedales.",
	["Kill Archmage Arugal and bring his head to Dalar Dawnweaver."] = "Mata al Archimago Arugal y llévale su cabeza a Dalar Tejealba.",
	["Kill Bazil Thredd in The Stockade and bring his head back to Warden Thelwater."] = "Mata a Bazil Thredd en Las Mazmorras y llévale su cabeza al Celador Thelagua.",
	["Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker inside Ragefire Chasm."] = "Mata a Bazzalan y a Jergosh el Convocador en la Sima Ígnea.",
	["Kill Dextren Ward in The Stockade and bring his hand to Councilman Millstipe."] = "Mata a Dextren Ward en Las Mazmorras y lleva su mano al Consejero Tallolino.",
	["Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod and Houndmaster Loksey, then report to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore."] = "Mata a la alta inquisidora Melenablanca, al comandante Escarlata Mograine, a Herod y al maestro de canes Loksey, y luego preséntate ante Raleigh el Devoto en Costasur.",
	["Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod and Houndmaster Loksey, then report to Varimathras in the Undercity."] = "Mata a la alta inquisidora Melenablanca, al comandante Escarlata Mograine, a Herod y al maestro de canes Loksey, y luego preséntate ante Varimathras en Entrañas.",
	["Kill Kam Deepfury in The Stockade and bring his head to Motley Garmason."] = "Mata a Kam Furiahonda en Las Mazmorras y lleva su cabeza a Motley Garmason.",
	["Kill Lady Anacondra, Lord Cobrahn, Lord Pythas and Lord Serpentis, then talk to the Disciple of Naralex at the entrance and escort him to Naralex. Protect him during the ritual: Mutanus comes at the end."] = "Mata a Lady Anacondra, Lord Cobrahn, Lord Pythas y Lord Serpentis; después habla con el Discípulo de Naralex en la entrada y escóltalo hasta Naralex. Protégelo durante el ritual: Mutanus aparece al final.",
	["Kill Mekgineer Thermaplugg and return to High Tinker Mekkatorque."] = "Mata al Mekigeniero Termochufe y regresa con el Manitas Mayor Mekkatorque.",
	["Kill Morphaz and take his blood to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood."] = "Mata a Morphaz y lleva su sangre a Greta Pezuñamusgo en Frondavil.",
	["KILL ON SIGHT, Badlands"] = "MATAR INMEDIATAMENTE, Tierras Inhóspitas",
	["KILL ON SIGHT: Dark Iron Dwarves"] = "MATAR INMEDIATAMENTE: enanos Hierro Negro",
	["KILL ON SIGHT: High Ranking Dark Iron Officials"] = "MATAR INMEDIATAMENTE: oficiales Hierro Negro de alto rango",
	["Kill Princess Theradras."] = "Mata a la princesa Theradras.",
	["Kill Rath'mael in Ruins of Lordaeron."] = "Mata a Rath'mael en las Ruinas de Lordaeron.",
	["Kill Shadow Hunter Vosh'gajin and bring her Snakestone to Kilram."] = "Mata a la cazadora de las Sombras Vosh'gajin y llévale su piedra culebra a Kilram.",
	["Kill Targorr the Dread in The Stockade and bring his head to Guard Berton."] = "Mata a Targorr el Pavoroso en Las Mazmorras y lleva su cabeza al Guardia Berton.",
	["Kill the Dark Iron Summoner first: he keeps bringing adds. Then turn on the elemental."] = "Mata primero al Invocador Hierro Negro: no deja de traer esbirros. Después, ve por el elemental.",
	["Kill the green drake Morphaz and bring his tooth to Ogtinc."] = "Mata al draco verde Morphaz y llévale su diente a Ogtinc.",
	["Kill the raptor matriarch in the tall grass. A wave of raptors comes when she dies, and Shadetooth runs in once they are dead."] = "Maten a la matriarca raptor en la hierba alta. Al morir ella llega una oleada de raptores, y Dentumbra entra corriendo cuando estos mueren.",
	["Kill the raptor matriarch in the tall grass. Her death brings a wave of raptors, and Shadetooth comes once they are dead: finish the whole wave before he arrives."] = "Maten a la matriarca raptor en la hierba alta. Su muerte atrae una oleada de raptores, y Dentumbra llega cuando estos mueren: acaben con toda la oleada antes de que él llegue.",
	["Kill the summoner first: he keeps bringing adds. Then turn on the elemental."] = "Mata primero al invocador: no deja de traer esbirros. Después, ve por el elemental.",
	["Kilram, Everlook, Winterspring"] = "Kilram, Vista Eterna, Cuna del Invierno",
	["King Magni Bronzebeard"] = "Rey Magni Barbabronce",
