	["Slows his target's movement for 10 seconds."] = "Reduce la velocidad de movimiento de su objetivo durante 10 s.",
	["Small raptors leap out of the grass as you walk through it, and make you bleed."] = "Al atravesar la hierba, saltan de ella pequeños raptores que te hacen sangrar.",
